{"id": "33941", "title": "尤物新娘(魔咒物语1)", "author": "艾佟", "category": "文学名著", "count": 52, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/33/33941.htm", "intro": "啥？32岁前找不到真爱就去见上帝？！他是文明人，谁会相信这种鬼诅咒，面对奶奶的逼婚，他根本完全不在意，但眼前这个尤物秘书倒真会“逼昏”他，不管自己有多生气，只要她嘟著嘴，无辜的抛抛媚眼，他的心就临阵倒戈投靠敌营去，人家没勾引他，他自己先乱想，且看她昏倒，他紧张兮兮，得知她一个人到垦丁散散心，怕她被小狼狗追走的他立刻跟去护花，他这总经理当到这里已经很不像样了，然而魔咒已经启动，现在说：人家还没有准备好，不知道来不来得及？……", "base": "files/article/html/33/33941", "chapters": [{"title": "序曲", "file": "2157940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2157941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2157942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2157943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2157944.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2157945.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2157946.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2157947.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2157948.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2157949.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2157950.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2157951.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2157952.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2157953.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2157954.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2157955.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2157956.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2157957.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2157958.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2157959.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2157960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2157961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2157962.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2157963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2157964.html",